  "originalQuery": "A Database Engineer has been asked to design a backup and recovery solution for a mission-critical database hosted on Google Cloud SQL. The database is expected to have a high rate of transactions and must have a low Recovery Point Objective (RPO) and Recovery Time Objective (RTO). Which of the following backup and recovery solutions would best meet these requirements?",
  "originalOptions": "A. Scheduled automated backups with daily frequency and point-in-time recovery enabled.<br/>B. Creating a read replica and promoting it to the primary instance when required.<br/>C. Using continuous backups through binary logging and point-in-time recovery enabled.<br/>D. Exporting the database to a Cloud Storage bucket on a weekly basis and importing it back when required.",
