  "qid": "84",
  "tip": "<p>When a question asks for near zero <i>RPO</i> and a minutes level <i>RTO</i> for Cloud SQL, think of <i>point in time recovery</i> with automated backups and binary logs rather than high availability or replicas. HA helps you stay up while PITR helps you get data back to an exact moment.</p>",
